window.EXAUD={"Work in pairs and act out the dialogue.": "audio/cau/9f80b4a8118b33e2.mp3", "We must act quickly to save water.": "audio/cau/2f2b0156a6f07db9.mp3", "We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "She actively takes part in class.": "audio/cau/3744bd9a9d414fa7.mp3", "We actively help clean the beach.": "audio/cau/886d6508a571df0e.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "She lives alone in a small flat.": "audio/cau/13d2d43093d9ae4b.mp3", "Don't go to the river alone.": "audio/cau/3571f8f1b5688fca.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Art is my favourite subject at school.": "audio/cau/c4a6c2883e22b179.mp3", "Lan loves art, and she wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/0ae231fa580deb96.mp3", "The artist paints pictures of Hoi An.": "audio/cau/01b6df3137316ebd.mp3", "Minh studies art because he wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/42793539c55d19cc.mp3", "My sister is very artistic.": "audio/cau/b1ceadac7bb085f5.mp3", "This painting has great artistic value.": "audio/cau/62c3d0ee107bea69.mp3", "I join the arts and crafts club after school.": "audio/cau/5e7e932441dc0390.mp3", "Art is fun, so Hoa joins the arts club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/d5e1ea90f787b38b.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The boys are kicking a ball in the yard.": "audio/cau/3f8cadab94b95593.mp3", "Nam has two balls: a football and a basketball.": "audio/cau/b1b40c9fa38ad76e.mp3", "She carries a basket of fruit.": "audio/cau/6eae7d2977cc4c40.mp3", "Put the rubbish in the basket.": "audio/cau/cc278d56ca6586e0.mp3", "Phong plays basketball very well.": "audio/cau/815cb672b9b09b86.mp3", "In basketball, players throw the ball into a basket.": "audio/cau/159e251e7a030755.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "I go to bed at ten o'clock.": "audio/cau/37f1c2a86a0f3867.mp3", "There is a bed and a desk in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/5306adc35ff279d9.mp3", "My bedroom is small but tidy.": "audio/cau/8f6e673cf7c0e7d7.mp3", "There is a big bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/a25f15f6ef9e509d.mp3", "Our house has three bedrooms.": "audio/cau/56d369b001af2fce.mp3", "Each bedroom has a bed and a desk.": "audio/cau/e433eafa2f6c6dd2.mp3", "Lan is my best friend.": "audio/cau/9edc7bdf247f31c3.mp3", "Mi's drawing is good, Nam's is better, but Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/c2336133ff2dce7f.mp3", "Life in the city is better for me.": "audio/cau/1aaaaca243bd56b5.mp3", "Lan's drawing is good, Mi's is better, and Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/eb8986ba6f0ca74b.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "My cat has black fur.": "audio/cau/a0b2fea708bf6f41.mp3", "Mi has black hair and a white shirt.": "audio/cau/ccf0d3ad0aca7115.mp3", "Fill in each blank with one word.": "audio/cau/0b238b46fd929b2f.mp3", "Write the correct answer in the blank.": "audio/cau/8d62e86f859c14ce.mp3", "Complete the blanks with the correct words.": "audio/cau/5278bb1298c4aa56.mp3", "There are five blanks, so fill each blank carefully.": "audio/cau/2e0163444ee11c94.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "My brother is ten years old.": "audio/cau/8117bffc8b9c9ebf.mp3", "Lan has two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/2a5491a08996a7e7.mp3", "I have two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/40fabe17eb0c1d6b.mp3", "Minh's brothers are tall, but his sister is short.": "audio/cau/75d0c7461a54ce03.mp3", "They want to build a new school here.": "audio/cau/acef8f351c194c82.mp3", "The builder built this house ten years ago.": "audio/cau/9b9a31fe503b70a0.mp3", "The builders are making a new school.": "audio/cau/fe7c529c4cac64d6.mp3", "My uncle is a builder.": "audio/cau/133450a7b43f7adb.mp3", "There is a tall building near my school.": "audio/cau/588e0855a319a85d.mp3", "Workers built that building in two years.": "audio/cau/7612edbcadc775d7.mp3", "The city has many modern buildings.": "audio/cau/7434af469630ef5f.mp3", "They are building new buildings near the river.": "audio/cau/f274abb27ac5c295.mp3", "This temple was built in 1070.": "audio/cau/1fec19fa7aebcfd9.mp3", "We built a sandcastle on the beach.": "audio/cau/57cbe6c05aace505.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "A friend of yours cannot get a good night's sleep.": "audio/cau/44dd417be1715182.mp3", "I cannot hear you. It's too noisy.": "audio/cau/c25f8e78a3e62ab2.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "Listen carefully and repeat after me.": "audio/cau/ad3f1bf6d7562211.mp3", "Mi is careful, so she always writes carefully.": "audio/cau/6be5befe9f5467c7.mp3", "Don't be careless with fire.": "audio/cau/3fa8f5ce401f56eb.mp3", "He made a careless mistake.": "audio/cau/0e576f1b557d8217.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "My little brother loves cartoons.": "audio/cau/e3de5f142d288cec.mp3", "Doraemon is a famous cartoon.": "audio/cau/4ede853821ac0fa6.mp3", "I watch cartoons on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/41a799be9617591a.mp3", "Cartoons make children laugh.": "audio/cau/db5cecd02de5d7a8.mp3", "Too many cars cause traffic jams.": "audio/cau/5ac4cbb3cb2d00fb.mp3", "Pollution is a cause of illness and can cause problems.": "audio/cau/b0502415132a3591.mp3", "We live in a central part of the city.": "audio/cau/56cb7cd26e890a65.mp3", "The central market is near the city centre.": "audio/cau/d3670c2095eba83a.mp3", "There is a community centre in my area.": "audio/cau/29303f0e938051fb.mp3", "The city centre is busy, and the central park is big.": "audio/cau/d087f6159981d3e2.mp3", "The girls are chatting in the playground.": "audio/cau/893aa9d28a50147c.mp3", "Hoa likes to chat, and now she is chatting with Chi.": "audio/cau/52dae974c0fd7e47.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "My classmates are very friendly.": "audio/cau/70f1668056519f2a.mp3", "Mi has one best friend and many classmates.": "audio/cau/203c4230a4c5b99f.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "She answered the question cleverly.": "audio/cau/b127f7ca5556eeca.mp3", "The robot is cleverly designed.": "audio/cau/78c94fc4362f7380.mp3", "Everyone praised his cleverness.": "audio/cau/8a333324f6d5417b.mp3", "The fox is known for its cleverness.": "audio/cau/165b55f081837120.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "I join the English club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/4854d8e45991624d.mp3", "Hoa is in the art club at school.": "audio/cau/1bf4d645fed3a1be.mp3", "Nam spends his free time on sports and clubs.": "audio/cau/f2ec04681e9b5639.mp3", "Our school has many clubs for students.": "audio/cau/e70f036f9c5e48ea.mp3", "Her email address ends in .com.": "audio/cau/20e848f753e16e67.mp3", "My email is nam@mail.com; we say 'nam at mail dot com'.": "audio/cau/eb39c1a3fa32e965.mp3", "My mum and I cook dinner in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/099d18a7b607e37e.mp3", "Dad is a good cook, and he loves cooking.": "audio/cau/ad61c98703aba283.mp3", "There's a cooker in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/ccb1cac6fa236187.mp3", "Mum is cooking rice on the cooker.": "audio/cau/2fb33fad1e4bbdd3.mp3", "Mi is cooking lunch now.": "audio/cau/cdaf6ad6f2a96daf.mp3", "My dad cooks well, and he is cooking fish today.": "audio/cau/656e2272945939a2.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "My cousin Lan lives in Hue.": "audio/cau/309e0790230bcfd2.mp3", "Nam has three cousins, and his cousin Minh is twelve.": "audio/cau/4f935c8501597824.mp3", "Use each cue to write a full sentence.": "audio/cau/d7a93e9030089010.mp3", "Lan looked at the cue on her card for a hint.": "audio/cau/e2b03a5b29eccd2b.mp3", "My little dog is very cute.": "audio/cau/40fd772b6ba6dec2.mp3", "Mi's baby sister is cute and lovely.": "audio/cau/06e5af2adbf27342.mp3", "Everyone loves the puppy's cuteness.": "audio/cau/8f9225069818a663.mp3", "The baby's cuteness made us smile.": "audio/cau/b38bbcc002f11870.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Daddy, can you read me a story?": "audio/cau/7b9c274b06183fb5.mp3", "My daddy works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/7cb12862406fc83e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "Mi and Hoa dance at the school party.": "audio/cau/356e0201b5187306.mp3", "My sister is a good dancer and loves to dance.": "audio/cau/e8fb6f50a3a6c011.mp3", "My sister wants to be a dancer.": "audio/cau/5d46a6b73d07af2c.mp3", "The dancer moved beautifully.": "audio/cau/fb89c401a2209ac5.mp3", "The girls are dancing in the yard.": "audio/cau/aa0c810aa58f1c78.mp3", "Nam likes dancing, and he dances well.": "audio/cau/c4264938bcc20b39.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Customs differ from country to country.": "audio/cau/867f1b35e7b382a9.mp3", "The twins differ in character.": "audio/cau/6fe7387847575daa.mp3", "What is the difference between these pictures?": "audio/cau/6c98c14e1c41bd67.mp3", "Small actions can make a big difference.": "audio/cau/2df232067e45e4a5.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "People think differently.": "audio/cau/f177b3ef34202d8f.mp3", "The word is spelled differently in American English.": "audio/cau/f1593ad480f9bd47.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "He faced many difficulties in his life.": "audio/cau/5216dd463282f548.mp3", "Life was difficult, but she overcame all her difficulties.": "audio/cau/85f00fb3e7683bff.mp3", "I have difficulty in pronouncing this word.": "audio/cau/f0983c29e5893490.mp3", "She solved the problem without difficulty.": "audio/cau/0c8af826fc6c33c1.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "Nam dislikes traffic jams in the city.": "audio/cau/7480fb2cc38a4f51.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but she dislikes loud noise.": "audio/cau/f3db0a5b4d041e4a.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "This notebook costs fifteen thousand dong.": "audio/cau/73acc66c00944007.mp3", "I paid twenty thousand dong for the bread.": "audio/cau/757309fc5d7a69ee.mp3", "Please close the door when you leave.": "audio/cau/afff0ef664915359.mp3", "Our house has a big front door and a small gate.": "audio/cau/609f4be9be5f1a33.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "Sorry, I couldn't get online earlier.": "audio/cau/8645d7f72d7fbd0a.mp3", "I get up early, but my mum gets up earlier.": "audio/cau/1bd88fc4d35df5af.mp3", "Steve Jobs' early life was not easy.": "audio/cau/870d0cf6ff3509a5.mp3", "Lan came early, but Nam came late.": "audio/cau/c338abccaad4e9f4.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "I write an email to my friend.": "audio/cau/8064d18c7a033e0f.mp3", "Lan emails me, and I read her email after school.": "audio/cau/b047656f3b7ce202.mp3", "The soldiers fought the enemy bravely.": "audio/cau/d7e74b5bf24e5f1e.mp3", "The cat is the enemy of the mouse.": "audio/cau/9cbb92de9d0d7660.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "Can you enlarge this photo?": "audio/cau/f7ea9d85d2ae68b7.mp3", "They plan to enlarge the school library.": "audio/cau/98d58917fdd12ccd.mp3", "I do my homework in the evening.": "audio/cau/4615eb9cc8fbce85.mp3", "Good evening! We have dinner every evening at seven.": "audio/cau/737b0c650458cf41.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Look at the audience and make eye contact.": "audio/cau/c4b16bbbce49770b.mp3", "Lan has big eyes and long black hair.": "audio/cau/15209ecb4d490c7b.mp3", "Mi has big black eyes.": "audio/cau/2dc803b2e1e6b728.mp3", "Close your eyes and touch your left eye.": "audio/cau/11b06c9c51e8a07e.mp3", "Many families live in flats in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/0f99802cf5d0ebaf.mp3", "Families get together at Tet.": "audio/cau/60357c1a8fa848a4.mp3", "There are four people in my family.": "audio/cau/8324f70f7fed9e74.mp3", "Many families in my village grow rice.": "audio/cau/5b179b43939643fc.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "My school is not far from my house.": "audio/cau/fa693a015c0f0c90.mp3", "Phong's house is farther from school than mine.": "audio/cau/a8e4b376469602b6.mp3", "The park is farther from my house than the school.": "audio/cau/57440ac0cbf1421c.mp3", "Hoa lives far from school, but Lan lives farther.": "audio/cau/1cfcda03be6a4095.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "I feed my cat twice a day.": "audio/cau/3a8f8f8f00f1daf9.mp3", "Yesterday Lan fed the fish in the pond.": "audio/cau/01b9c59f1a6a6265.mp3", "Fill in the gaps with the correct words.": "audio/cau/fdb1b1c53693f72e.mp3", "Mi fills the glass, and now it is full.": "audio/cau/ebdf9cc5c316901a.mp3", "Lan gives her friend a beautiful flower.": "audio/cau/fa4bac5dc4a6c0ef.mp3", "There are many flowers in my grandma's garden.": "audio/cau/a14860aa91d79b28.mp3", "How about putting some flowers on the table?": "audio/cau/2b9b6c204f34cab8.mp3", "My grandma grows flowers in her garden.": "audio/cau/8e0ebaa5f0e0c564.mp3", "We need food and water every day.": "audio/cau/01b6dc39aa643a2b.mp3", "Mum feeds the baby healthy food.": "audio/cau/1407b84140607171.mp3", "Phong plays football with his friends.": "audio/cau/9baf509a6408f617.mp3", "Nam likes football and watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/617a4e3bf9b2e89d.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Tourists love the friendliness of local people.": "audio/cau/a40be7352a7002db.mp3", "Her friendliness makes everyone happy.": "audio/cau/a90e79e9d7f1fffe.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "My new school is further from home.": "audio/cau/75bf280216804478.mp3", "Hoa walks far, but Minh walks further.": "audio/cau/2debf8693d0b2c6c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Nam likes computer games, but his favourite game is chess.": "audio/cau/7f58cb7638af0917.mp3", "Fill in each gap with a word from the box.": "audio/cau/afa644b720499eae.mp3", "Read the sentence, then fill the gap with the right word.": "audio/cau/1c138053d1f45bdd.mp3", "My grandmother has a small garden.": "audio/cau/ad0b9ba5604dc0f5.mp3", "Grandpa loves gardening, so our garden is beautiful.": "audio/cau/2afdcb2a5601fa6f.mp3", "The gardener waters the flowers every day.": "audio/cau/22a67e0a027f6f3e.mp3", "My grandpa is a good gardener.": "audio/cau/ab1e7c940217b2ba.mp3", "My grandpa enjoys gardening in his free time.": "audio/cau/fcd49413f27e2295.mp3", "Gardening is fun, and our garden looks beautiful.": "audio/cau/59d0b9e54bc0416e.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "It's getting dark, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/a5d44c2a5398af17.mp3", "Minh got up late, so he is getting ready quickly.": "audio/cau/be131cb99a335b88.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "My grandma tells us stories every night.": "audio/cau/96809300e183923c.mp3", "Grandma and Grandpa live with us.": "audio/cau/8051252f03d98b36.mp3", "My grandmother makes conical hats by hand.": "audio/cau/fb6599cb79d9916d.mp3", "Lan calls her grandmother 'Grandma'.": "audio/cau/61992d8dfda62651.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/14d9858e971da542.mp3", "Minh visits his grandparents; his grandfather has a farm.": "audio/cau/ff809b7d116e870e.mp3", "Granny tells me stories every night.": "audio/cau/e5e7ca2e8b433e14.mp3", "I visit my granny on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b2eaecf09b65cf7d.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "My mother has long black hair.": "audio/cau/41b2fceab317cdd9.mp3", "Phong's hair is short because he had a haircut.": "audio/cau/63f3438257726452.mp3", "I need a haircut.": "audio/cau/7d93abbd1c7b72f7.mp3", "Do you like my new haircut?": "audio/cau/f47102da0cfc35d6.mp3", "My aunt is a hairdresser.": "audio/cau/08be3cd9c8f14bf9.mp3", "I go to the hairdresser's once a month.": "audio/cau/a2858025cc239abe.mp3", "My dog has long, hairy ears.": "audio/cau/041d7835247f9da0.mp3", "The spider has hairy legs.": "audio/cau/f2a919f0ec51fd15.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Can you hear the birds singing?": "audio/cau/3f4cc69da3af7ba9.mp3", "I heard a strange noise last night.": "audio/cau/a1184ef7d4830b99.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "The shop assistant answered helpfully.": "audio/cau/0b65805c79b864c9.mp3", "She helpfully showed me the way.": "audio/cau/5386979ac33e124d.mp3", "Nam helps his father in the garden.": "audio/cau/872717d07d581517.mp3", "Lan is helpful, and she likes to help her friends.": "audio/cau/1681abe8d625bbeb.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "I felt homesick on my first day at camp.": "audio/cau/4d3a402933ae59e2.mp3", "Students studying abroad often feel homesick.": "audio/cau/ea48648e9a7d5f77.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "How did he become a famous doctor?": "audio/cau/0acfb865542d1705.mp3", "How old is Minh, and how does he go to school?": "audio/cau/0d6be1faa0d18a2b.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "My teacher is very humorous.": "audio/cau/8f6ba9ed4e3a796d.mp3", "I read a humorous story yesterday.": "audio/cau/d81d0caf2c1c6edb.mp3", "Watching TV all day makes you inactive.": "audio/cau/41590c23ceb7a257.mp3", "The volcano has been inactive for years.": "audio/cau/6cfc968444b1c2e9.mp3", "Chess is an indoor game.": "audio/cau/cadc57959ec34895.mp3", "Our school has an indoor swimming pool.": "audio/cau/83a64499cbb9212c.mp3", "After 'How about', we use the verb with -ing.": "audio/cau/0b5b2f5d668491cd.mp3", "How about buying a new lamp for your bedroom?": "audio/cau/55a020c7bbf1ac54.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "Interview your friends about their hobbies.": "audio/cau/d3665ae8a019b847.mp3", "The interviewer asks questions in the interview.": "audio/cau/17933513ebd68309.mp3", "We interviewed an artisan in our village.": "audio/cau/c459b51d68c47c0f.mp3", "Lan interviewed her grandpa, and the interview was fun.": "audio/cau/7bf3beb59681e5ac.mp3", "The interviewee answered all the questions.": "audio/cau/e3a89b2877a4f3d2.mp3", "Work in pairs: one is the interviewer, one is the interviewee.": "audio/cau/b669d3237b304618.mp3", "The interviewer asked about my hobbies.": "audio/cau/0d6e97a77dcf1c09.mp3", "She works as a TV interviewer.": "audio/cau/b7a7e609de5b577a.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "She smiled kindly at me.": "audio/cau/1f6770a4e642e4ad.mp3", "He kindly helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/355561eff4531966.mp3", "Thank you for your kindness.": "audio/cau/5a1909574805c9b6.mp3", "Small acts of kindness make people happy.": "audio/cau/591eeb7107114f71.mp3", "My mother is cooking in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/78039550cb0990ea.mp3", "There is a big fridge in our kitchen.": "audio/cau/9d911699ef4d8574.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "The town is largely quiet at night.": "audio/cau/6acff2f7d5971d4e.mp3", "Our success is largely due to teamwork.": "audio/cau/f39589c55d704f4b.mp3", "Don't be late for school!": "audio/cau/2de1bb7c8bcc4ad3.mp3", "Mi was late, but Nam came early.": "audio/cau/1f3ff224e4611670.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "Mai often listens to music after school.": "audio/cau/31ddd3c6192ed294.mp3", "My brother listens to the radio in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/d938596ae05dc701.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "My cousin lives in a flat in the city centre.": "audio/cau/6c1c9af9fa483b7a.mp3", "Lan lives in Da Nang, and her grandparents live in Hoi An.": "audio/cau/cad509dd3acaf3f4.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "Mathematics is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/d1ab0d00c545c65c.mp3", "We have mathematics on Monday.": "audio/cau/2a9734a9eaf4d58b.mp3", "Maths is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/c4dbac3c27e1034e.mp3", "Mathematics, or maths, is hard but fun.": "audio/cau/6ffbed30122c7baa.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Every family member helps with the housework.": "audio/cau/8fa1a66c09c2ea18.mp3", "Mai is a member of the club, and membership is free.": "audio/cau/01456e371fd4ed8a.mp3", "Club membership is free for students.": "audio/cau/ae8e8efa3939377b.mp3", "I have a library membership card.": "audio/cau/11c3d535f525e9b3.mp3", "Mai sends me a message every evening.": "audio/cau/a9c6b25a2357a625.mp3", "Can I leave a message for Mr Minh?": "audio/cau/5ea5e2442839d4cb.mp3", "I chat with my friends on Messenger.": "audio/cau/e7524dcb65b59059.mp3", "The messenger brought a letter.": "audio/cau/73a3333eb8f61f02.mp3", "Mai sits in the middle of the first row.": "audio/cau/fb9af6047d7545a8.mp3", "There is a table in the middle, or centre, of the room.": "audio/cau/d1fcde7c79b36590.mp3", "I get up at six every morning.": "audio/cau/838c5da1aad62be2.mp3", "We study in the morning and play in the evening.": "audio/cau/8a176d8289d946ce.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "Motherhood is a wonderful job.": "audio/cau/a41df636f68c1eb3.mp3", "She enjoys motherhood very much.": "audio/cau/aae8c60a567bd35c.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "Can you play a musical instrument?": "audio/cau/4b45a019b7f1df1c.mp3", "She comes from a musical family.": "audio/cau/da92e12306feca96.mp3", "Trinh Cong Son is a famous musician.": "audio/cau/44ebea42904bff46.mp3", "She wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/a69499a50cc7cc48.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "What is your full name?": "audio/cau/3560e14e0864aa5c.mp3", "Name two products Jobs introduced after 1997.": "audio/cau/2fa79a695478cb53.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "My neighbour is very friendly.": "audio/cau/d2fc8d7467f7e5ea.mp3", "Our neighbour lives in a quiet neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/87674a9bcb6c8bff.mp3", "There are many craft shops in my neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/5a60ecba646b7ca3.mp3", "Friendly neighbours make the neighbourhood a nice place.": "audio/cau/f366b98c116e30a6.mp3", "Our neighbours are very kind.": "audio/cau/51381ce3399ddfb9.mp3", "We know all the neighbours in our neighbourhood.": "audio/cau/d5d36369d40be385.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "The children played noisily.": "audio/cau/91ef21d722603a6c.mp3", "Don't eat noisily.": "audio/cau/47c9f7f3b63e2c3f.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "This is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/112d241056ccf384.mp3", "My grandpa is the oldest in my family.": "audio/cau/9f9847641a26a88e.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "My friends and I like playing outdoors.": "audio/cau/b93328230ef90e2f.mp3", "It's sunny today, so let's eat our lunch outdoors.": "audio/cau/5f24f91daf666c75.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "Every parent loves their children.": "audio/cau/f0f02e141cda079d.mp3", "My mum is a kind parent.": "audio/cau/fc0100e2293df4cc.mp3", "This app has parental controls.": "audio/cau/8a73f889c7960108.mp3", "Children need parental love.": "audio/cau/74f6bcb6352c58be.mp3", "My parents are always kind and patient.": "audio/cau/f70296736693e0b8.mp3", "My dad is a busy parent, but my parents always eat dinner with us.": "audio/cau/02cfa7df92c1de83.mp3", "Read the passage and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/9a3c0d57d2e7ee93.mp3", "This passage is about Tet.": "audio/cau/6d3bf3c7448a33f3.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Hoa has a friendly personality.": "audio/cau/5e968c0ca289e9bb.mp3", "Minh has a strong character and a kind personality.": "audio/cau/e35df7bcc2cd6179.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "She phoned her mother every evening.": "audio/cau/349bb738f214ff06.mp3", "Nam phoned Minh, and Minh called him back.": "audio/cau/23c05f3d2997559f.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "There is a plant next to the window.": "audio/cau/ead07f80a6f49805.mp3", "Mi plants flowers and waters the plants every day.": "audio/cau/8379ade47936222a.mp3", "Plants need water and sunlight.": "audio/cau/e6bc337addd58412.mp3", "People make com from young rice plants.": "audio/cau/5ab8c23c4ad5e1eb.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "He is a good football player.": "audio/cau/2592e456810d1a0e.mp3", "Each player has three cards.": "audio/cau/2733b581f437ad82.mp3", "My puppy is very playful.": "audio/cau/2a941a50bd420b1b.mp3", "She has a playful smile.": "audio/cau/f0b4790d33181781.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "Phong is playing football with his friends.": "audio/cau/fd009e447f675c7d.mp3", "Mi likes playing chess, and she is a good player.": "audio/cau/4637524c7f8926bf.mp3", "Good preparation helps you pass the exam.": "audio/cau/b4ceb37a596fa919.mp3", "Tet preparation takes a long time.": "audio/cau/55a2bf2f74de18c9.mp3", "Many teens like street food more than food prepared at home.": "audio/cau/6d55de4036adf579.mp3", "We prepared a short talk about our city.": "audio/cau/086e339f2e3d6d8a.mp3", "Lan prepares for her English test every evening.": "audio/cau/85f962febf61124a.mp3", "Nam prepares his school bag the night before.": "audio/cau/7c2c15a0efb4d1b7.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "She has a pretty face.": "audio/cau/b4057ea8bc4143dd.mp3", "The test was pretty easy.": "audio/cau/c3222808c2b9263e.mp3", "Traffic is a big problem in my city.": "audio/cau/a9430caf947cc643.mp3", "We can solve this problem together.": "audio/cau/776a98146a24a856.mp3", "Big cities have many problems, like noise and pollution.": "audio/cau/24dc719026b8e32f.mp3", "The biggest problem is the traffic.": "audio/cau/efeb9ddaeddd8a26.mp3", "Use the prompts to write the email.": "audio/cau/e1a7e4175bdfabfb.mp3", "Look at the prompt and answer.": "audio/cau/2768ecf1a33cb452.mp3", "The pupils are playing in the yard.": "audio/cau/1178005118de5a59.mp3", "All pupils must wear uniforms.": "audio/cau/f08e1de8875b988c.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "Please speak quietly in the library.": "audio/cau/d3d8ecfcd2451005.mp3", "She closed the door quietly.": "audio/cau/ca20754f99efde5b.mp3", "I love the quietness of the countryside.": "audio/cau/13091db4624edf0a.mp3", "The quietness helped me study.": "audio/cau/b9d1231d026f5544.mp3", "The film was quite good.": "audio/cau/03ed8ad23ecd5167.mp3", "It's quite cold today.": "audio/cau/bae99bcbc3e62e6b.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "My grandpa listens to the radio every morning.": "audio/cau/d66c1df1a3a69b89.mp3", "I heard the news on the radio.": "audio/cau/6e553d609cae07e6.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Give one reason why you like your friend.": "audio/cau/a3f79369c8db7055.mp3", "The price is reasonable, and that is my reason for buying it.": "audio/cau/f927cd67a281473b.mp3", "The prices here are reasonable.": "audio/cau/ae60767c664ffa40.mp3", "That's a reasonable idea.": "audio/cau/a58450244623d611.mp3", "There are many reasons to make new friends.": "audio/cau/b4aec367cd011148.mp3", "Write two reasons, and explain each reason.": "audio/cau/0e00874bd41b6407.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Report your group's ideas to the class.": "audio/cau/6522433ccfce4976.mp3", "The reporter wrote a report about our village.": "audio/cau/136adff9e04b464a.mp3", "The reporter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/3220169670e28ec1.mp3", "She wants to be a TV reporter.": "audio/cau/d6499b08f001431b.mp3", "If you don't feel well, you can stay at home and rest.": "audio/cau/80c50d7bcdc0aa2e.mp3", "Hoa rests for ten minutes after running.": "audio/cau/0e4d9ca9b895f037.mp3", "My room is small but very tidy.": "audio/cau/bd9658dea75a069a.mp3", "There are five rooms in my house.": "audio/cau/a28138f93ee20867.mp3", "How many rooms are there in your house?": "audio/cau/0c361cf1ff3149ce.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I feel sad when it rains.": "audio/cau/eb933f7742f31790.mp3", "It's a sad story.": "audio/cau/609036f450dba425.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "Mum says breakfast is ready.": "audio/cau/4bcfdde7be1c67e6.mp3", "Yesterday the teacher said 'Good job', and today she says it again.": "audio/cau/2213f432702e6aed.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "My schoolbag is too heavy today.": "audio/cau/8d0a65c64cf8ce99.mp3", "She puts her books in her schoolbag.": "audio/cau/3f97f32ee71ad86a.mp3", "Lan is my schoolmate, not my classmate.": "audio/cau/e2d3147caa8ce83b.mp3", "I met a schoolmate at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/600fe95b9cf0ba63.mp3", "I am a student at a secondary school.": "audio/cau/48bf042580b991b7.mp3", "Secondary students learn many different subjects.": "audio/cau/987e6aeb45e49a3a.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "Air pollution is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/451a7484a9226374.mp3", "Our teacher looks serious today.": "audio/cau/128bbd7598114bcd.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "Shortly after that, he moved to Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/11ea9cd1ebe627ae.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so wait here.": "audio/cau/c03ac79a596be37a.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "My sister is kind and very funny.": "audio/cau/682ebfe0aa138164.mp3", "I have one sister and two brothers.": "audio/cau/14c3dc4d63096025.mp3", "I sleep for eight hours every night.": "audio/cau/2d2df36764b2d3d8.mp3", "Nam went to bed late, so he feels sleepy now.": "audio/cau/f0fe4a120a290c36.mp3", "The baby is sleeping in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/db81987b31c201bb.mp3", "Shh! Grandpa is sleeping; he slept badly last night.": "audio/cau/474463118f396d2d.mp3", "If you're sleepy, you shouldn't ride your bike.": "audio/cau/24b06618dda8e4ce.mp3", "Hoa felt sleepy because she went to bed late.": "audio/cau/6ce80e5117754f2f.mp3", "I slept for eight hours last night.": "audio/cau/7df7ccc05b0d2427.mp3", "The baby slept well after lunch.": "audio/cau/29bc4a7836effc76.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "Different societies have different customs.": "audio/cau/ace4334dd14f3456.mp3", "Our school has many student societies.": "audio/cau/fe1ba346b0931c47.mp3", "See you soon at school, Mi!": "audio/cau/fec53904fbd07d51.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so we'll be home soon.": "audio/cau/b92c6bf10bdd4a35.mp3", "Speaking English is fun for me.": "audio/cau/5e0c5c8f032037bd.mp3", "Phong spoke very well at the speaking contest last week.": "audio/cau/a7b7e89c25abf298.mp3", "We stay in tents at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/2e09709e31b8333c.mp3", "Mi will stay at home, but Nam will leave early.": "audio/cau/d5c48ac441b0c097.mp3", "We're staying at the Crazy House Hotel.": "audio/cau/a64a2e7aa9bd275a.mp3", "I'm staying with my grandparents this summer.": "audio/cau/9925267e92b40f5d.mp3", "My grandmother tells us funny stories.": "audio/cau/e69e0bbbad7fb5c7.mp3", "This story is the best of all the stories.": "audio/cau/1eb1cd37d5f5f117.mp3", "Let me tell you the story of my life.": "audio/cau/d98d4ebd73512026.mp3", "Mr Minh is a good storyteller; his story is moving.": "audio/cau/394bef52e88a63eb.mp3", "My grandma is a great storyteller.": "audio/cau/5e7c88fb2310eebf.mp3", "The storyteller made the children laugh.": "audio/cau/3b52a1dad829ac46.mp3", "Our maths teacher is strict but kind.": "audio/cau/5a45c0849794934f.mp3", "My parents are strict about bedtime.": "audio/cau/038329d9c1a1bddd.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "My favourite subject is science.": "audio/cau/a04c6f77a736db47.mp3", "Maths is a hard subject, but I like it.": "audio/cau/47c097cdda067846.mp3", "We study ten subjects at school.": "audio/cau/65e4952b532af83a.mp3", "Of all my subjects, English is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/b316509d6a4659ff.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "Nguyen is a common surname in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/c8102c73dadc352c.mp3", "What is your surname?": "audio/cau/67eafe2d8243a1d5.mp3", "This mango is very sweet.": "audio/cau/a1e5323b108609f7.mp3", "What a sweet little girl!": "audio/cau/629dd9e3583638d0.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "It takes ten minutes to walk to my school.": "audio/cau/ca3f18f9d6d14e9b.mp3", "Minh takes the bus every day, but today he took a taxi.": "audio/cau/43ccee96993861c9.mp3", "Children love fairy tales.": "audio/cau/bcae153c0f88b396.mp3", "He told funny tales about his travels.": "audio/cau/ad7211d182774e8b.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "Mi and Lan are talking about their new house.": "audio/cau/db4593c0356937da.mp3", "Nam is talkative; he is always talking in class.": "audio/cau/40601d08103ee713.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "We are thankful to our teachers.": "audio/cau/7371a36dadb99e53.mp3", "Our teachers help us every day.": "audio/cau/7e121ff7d4ccdde3.mp3", "Ms Lan is teaching Class 6A now.": "audio/cau/acf50be4cb481bbc.mp3", "My aunt is a teacher; she loves teaching.": "audio/cau/8c228681a916a270.mp3", "Can I use your telephone, please?": "audio/cau/aa7a5d67add41cf4.mp3", "Alexander Graham Bell invented the telephone.": "audio/cau/38ca1e3fa8439b54.mp3", "There is a television in the living room.": "audio/cau/b6e9f08b84a3491c.mp3", "My grandma watches television in the evening.": "audio/cau/405c173d0715402b.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "Mi often tells funny jokes in class.": "audio/cau/a45b431c2cc8b2fc.mp3", "Hoa tells me everything; yesterday she told me a secret.": "audio/cau/0bfc816828146f08.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "Read the text and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/11d0eb5cbe887ed7.mp3", "The text is on page 20 of the textbook.": "audio/cau/d58a68e9e3987cad.mp3", "Open your textbook at page 20.": "audio/cau/915c1eaa49971a81.mp3", "I forgot my English textbook at home.": "audio/cau/a4a2d63649c29215.mp3", "Read the two texts and compare them.": "audio/cau/c807be1a6c25d189.mp3", "Mi sends me texts every day; this text is from her.": "audio/cau/2bea2a0f26cc7d4b.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "My grandma told me a funny story.": "audio/cau/f87f67862f96ec79.mp3", "The teacher told us to be quiet.": "audio/cau/42fba1ee1bbe34c4.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "When he was a child, he made a toy car.": "audio/cau/6f55bb595426c451.mp3", "My little sister has a lot of toys.": "audio/cau/1a03b2143fe383da.mp3", "The children's toys are in the box.": "audio/cau/cdeee14e089eb2bf.mp3", "My little brother has many toys.": "audio/cau/a0a23376fa568974.mp3", "Modern trains are fast and comfortable.": "audio/cau/8b4a45bf6ab046c4.mp3", "This train is slow, but the other trains are fast.": "audio/cau/cbb801f7379db876.mp3", "There is a big TV in our living room.": "audio/cau/12dac61f7442af7c.mp3", "Nam watches TV after dinner, and his television is new.": "audio/cau/f8c696f4133477c5.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "Don't be uncaring to your friends.": "audio/cau/04bee2cbc921dc0a.mp3", "He seemed cold and uncaring.": "audio/cau/d166d31db07821d4.mp3", "The new neighbour seems unfriendly.": "audio/cau/0e1c5a5441788b1d.mp3", "Don't be unfriendly to new classmates.": "audio/cau/6506d305aef12ce1.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "The workers wear a green uniform with stripes.": "audio/cau/b182c1a9488baa66.mp3", "We wear our school uniform from Monday to Friday.": "audio/cau/4c928807169b0cdf.mp3", "The film was long and uninteresting.": "audio/cau/fe255bc43d0bc7d1.mp3", "Nothing is uninteresting if you look closely.": "audio/cau/fbd9a81d434e40b7.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "They are watching a cartoon now.": "audio/cau/4d078d8c29b3de5f.mp3", "Phong likes watching football; he watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/67283f87df189657.mp3", "Can I have some water, please?": "audio/cau/e7f9c90ffdf43ef9.mp3", "Hoa waters the plants with rainwater.": "audio/cau/63d57a63a01495bc.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Where do you live, Lan?": "audio/cau/0c6d7d3df1a25694.mp3", "Where is my schoolbag, Mum?": "audio/cau/57a3c3d221996a0d.mp3", "Where's the bed? It's next to the window.": "audio/cau/640eff7ddd6c8116.mp3", "Where's Nick's bag? It's under the bed.": "audio/cau/36d364164efec528.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "My cat is white, but my dog is black.": "audio/cau/6830d20c0f7fe4b8.mp3", "Why do you like this book?": "audio/cau/f853b0b3138e4625.mp3", "'Why are you late?' 'Because I missed the bus.'": "audio/cau/c4cf7bd9b30f00fd.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "I do a short workout every morning.": "audio/cau/ec44b668a8c4effe.mp3", "That workout was really tiring.": "audio/cau/54e243382f7202bb.mp3", "David works out at his home gym.": "audio/cau/56b62fa69d74bb24.mp3", "My mother works at a hospital.": "audio/cau/487e7f958fd4338f.mp3", "This is the worst film I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/2b6b7e86b637f5bc.mp3", "Monday is the worst day of the week for me.": "audio/cau/40b0df75c1307d68.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "The children are playing in the yard.": "audio/cau/a60292e0b853b7c9.mp3", "There is a mango tree in our yard.": "audio/cau/a81662a28a29ab2a.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "The school has a yearly sports day.": "audio/cau/750d62eaf703f585.mp3", "We have a yearly health check.": "audio/cau/4c5595be96ba759a.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3", "I'm the youngest in my family.": "audio/cau/2b5949097bc49b2c.mp3", "She is the youngest student in the class.": "audio/cau/3af170b5e214d1ff.mp3"};
